{"version":1,"key":"card:528","content":{"id":528,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7d8988b8-99f9-49f2-b56a-12c438bad363","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有一个美国的电视游戏节目 Let's Make a Deal，参赛者会看见三扇关闭了的门，其中一扇的后面有一辆汽车，另外两扇门后面则各藏有一只山羊，选中了汽车就可以获得该汽车。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4fb885ca-dd4e-4de4-acb8-ece0fd2fc763","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当参赛者选定了一扇门但还未打开的时候，节目主持人会打开另外两扇门中包含山羊的那一扇门，然后问参赛者要不要换另一扇仍然关上的门，这就是三门问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"13271d24-d689-4d19-ab98-0e5125fc9e91","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"80% 的参赛者都会选择不换，当主持人排除掉一扇门之后，大多数想的是我选的这扇门背后是汽车的概率和另一扇背后是汽车的概率都是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/2","collabId":"986d5efe-6d15-4518-a6e9-67ddf6f1964b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果换了，但是自己原来自己选对了，那么会非常的后悔，因此在这种情况下都不会换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1cfb6d92-ae71-4df2-8e85-320ff651ac8e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们从数学上进行分析，是否该换，首先定义事件："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"de099eec-cc6d-4e39-9074-7bbb15afc735","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"23e55124-e33c-4179-b939-51b9b9037da8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e580dc37-68e1-4828-8662-959e5e4e5ca1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设三扇门为 (A, B, C)，奖品随机藏在其中一扇门后，概率均等："},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(A) = P(B) = P(C) = \\cfrac{1}{3}","collabId":"e13e3337-b39f-4afa-99bf-0b9b9ee2528f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(A) = P(B) = P(C) = \\frac{1}{3}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" "}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"f1812d04-4637-4b36-8cd9-e1ccbe9d4af6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d5f9030-8576-4de9-9a57-81d802fc1d80","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参赛者选择门 (A)（选择其他门逻辑相同）。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d2510b5e-1b34-4b31-b6b7-217fb66feff6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91ae62c8-3eb1-4e08-a8fb-c7817e8ef4b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"主持人知道奖品位置，并会打开一扇无奖品的门（例如打开门 (C)）。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d69d45ab-52d3-45e7-8474-4a28eafc0ed9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c8a5ef0-5bf9-4cdd-98d9-ed869d79f0a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"设事件 (H) 表示主持人打开门 (C)。"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"06b43a99-76eb-4c16-9379-43bcb0073365","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们需要计算的在打开 C 的情况下 A 后面是汽车的概率 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(A|H)","collabId":"b3a6af0c-ffc0-45ea-ac1d-ca19c71f9f0b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(A|H)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以及在打开 C 的情况下 B 后面是汽车的概率 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(B|H)","collabId":"87e14dee-1eb8-4eb0-a3f1-39511676f14d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(B|H)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35dbafbb-fd39-4e30-8da6-24517f8591bd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据贝叶斯定理"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP(A|H) &= \\frac{P(H|A) \\cdot P(A)}{P(H)} \\\\ \nP(B|H) &= \\frac{P(H|B) \\cdot P(B)}{P(H)}\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"03a676d4-8e91-4854-bf9c-f0a111e71950","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8e2a688b-b795-43cd-996a-1e9e3da1e8c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"阐述各项的含义及值："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"55163fff-b865-42d7-a8fd-a7245c026d5d","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e7d85b4e-50e8-4086-8a81-7d54b59e71c9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9cbc9196-0de6-45b1-a715-98590562ebd4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(H|A)","collabId":"ceacea98-e066-4a72-b3d2-203ba577d575","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H|A)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在 A 后面是汽车的情况下打开 C 的概率，因为 B 和 C 后面都是山羊，因此概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/2","collabId":"6ba5efd9-262d-40eb-a95d-b3e45680d228","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"bb551223-f034-4723-8065-ada8d5283946","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c7635327-8385-4c46-82f0-ac7cafcb5a86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(H|B)","collabId":"8b8cee2d-7e30-459e-8843-6cc0e07fb86e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H|B)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"：在 B 后面是汽车的情况下打开 C，这个概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1","collabId":"84dcaa65-9176-48ec-955b-cc54b912beb3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a914bd9b-a8f0-4eda-b8ac-99093c6b9c79","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3bbba9fa-404e-4c46-8863-fa59dbf32887","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(H)","collabId":"c472f397-42f5-4dcf-99a0-bb7de6df476d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H)"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"：根据全概率公式，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"P(H) = P(A)P(H|A) + P(B)P(H|B) = 1/6 + 1/3 = 1/2","collabId":"ca287b27-616a-4fd9-aee6-3475f96f98da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"P(H) = P(A)P(H|A) + P(B)P(H|B) = 1/6 + 1/3 = 1/2"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"272cc6e6-ec5a-4af2-946c-a8888439ff47","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"代入计算可以得到"}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP(A|H) &= \\frac{1/2 \\cdot 1/3}{1/2} &= \\frac{1}{3} \\\\\nP(B|H) &= \\frac{1 \\cdot 1/3}{1/2} &= \\frac{2}{3}\n\\end{aligned}","collabId":"8c535853-a169-432b-8427-02e203c0371d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0f4b8446-5290-41e5-a03c-3afc69a1d006","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在换的情况下选中汽车的概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2/3","collabId":"ae224967-085f-4cfc-9dc5-e4aa12426299","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不换选中汽车的概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/3","collabId":"d6c3a358-0ffb-4a32-8e5a-82f060215f8c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以策略应当是换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1d1bbf21-a399-48ea-9b32-866e3d6968c1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通俗的理解三门问题，可以把自己选的门和其他的两个门分为两堆，汽车在我选的堆中的概率是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"1/3","collabId":"23b553ee-21bd-4ff4-8af2-63408a69d55e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，在另一堆中是 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"2/3","collabId":"1f6a2511-11c8-4ba4-b7b6-3542dc44ad55","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2/3"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。现在如果让你按堆换，堆里面有汽车就算中奖，让你换你换不换，肯定换，没有人不换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d469c09f-e01b-41d5-bf4b-16b082ef94b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"现在有人说另一堆其中有一个是没中的，这是句废话，并且告诉你哪个没有，等价于把概率从一堆坍缩到了一个，然后问你换不换，你居然不换。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e0472f3b-352b-40b4-8dbf-2f7fa77a558a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果还是不够直觉，现在假设不是三扇门，而是一百扇门，一个是你选的，另外 99 扇主持人排除了 98 个，问你换不换，你还敢说你选的这扇门有汽车的概率和剩下的一扇门有汽车的概率都还是 1/2 吗？"}]}],"tags":["数学/概率","反直觉"],"createTime":1740825765118,"updateTime":1792804206953,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1792804206953}}